  'ui.b272_tools_numbers_desc': ["Formulas are checked against worked examples. Values come from the built-in PokeMMO data; where something is uncertain, an ⓘ next to it explains why.","Las fórmulas se comprueban con ejemplos. Los valores proceden de los datos incluidos de PokeMMO; el icono ⓘ explica cualquier incertidumbre.","公式已用实例校验，数值来自内置 PokeMMO 数据；如有不确定之处，旁边的 ⓘ 会解释原因。"],
